{"type":"standard","title":"Greg Steube","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Greg Steube</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q5606295","titles":{"canonical":"Greg_Steube","normalized":"Greg Steube","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Greg Steube</span></span>"},"pageid":36321070,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/Greg_Steube_117th_Congress.jpeg/330px-Greg_Steube_117th_Congress.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":484},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/57/Greg_Steube_117th_Congress.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":750,"height":1100},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1370581736","tid":"c5e6abeb-9db7-11f1-8970-29274c82f6a6","timestamp":"2026-08-21T23:26:45Z","description":"American politician (born 1978)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greg_Steube","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greg_Steube?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greg_Steube?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Greg_Steube"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greg_Steube","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Greg_Steube","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greg_Steube?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Greg_Steube"}},"extract":"William Gregory Steube is an American politician serving as the U.S. representative for Florida's 17th congressional district since 2019. His district is based in Sarasota. A member of the Republican Party, Steube served three terms in the Florida House of Representatives, representing the Sarasota-Manatee area from 2010 to 2016, as well as two years in the Florida Senate until 2018, representing Sarasota County and the western part of Charlotte County.","extract_html":"<p><b>William Gregory Steube</b> is an American politician serving as the U.S. representative for Florida's 17th congressional district since 2019. His district is based in Sarasota. A member of the Republican Party, Steube served three terms in the Florida House of Representatives, representing the Sarasota-Manatee area from 2010 to 2016, as well as two years in the Florida Senate until 2018, representing Sarasota County and the western part of Charlotte County.</p>"}